.i da mi no spisa be la daminospitsas cu setese dunda
(Someone gave me no pieces of Domino's(R) Pizza)

.i gerna fi lu ganra grana garna li'u
("A broad-stick railing" is grammatical)

.i le tilju xarju noi rinju xabju lo  ralju konju bo kamju poi midju
lo bidju briju  bo dinju cu sidju fi tu'a lo narju tsiju vanju
(The heavy pig, which is constrained to reside at the principal
conical pillar that is at the center of the beaded office building,
helps out with the orange-colored-seed wine.)
(Anybody but me notice how many Jews...errrr.. "ju"'s there are in the
gismu list?)

                    --gejyspa


